of its population living in urban areas. Moscow, the most populous metropolitan area in Europe, is the capital and largest city of Russia, while Saint Petersburg is its second-largest city and a major cultural centre.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russia","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"RU"}],"arc":{"reports":77,"first_seen":"2026-10-09T11:55:51Z","first_title":"Ukraine strikes Russian tech giant’s data centres","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxObUxpOTJRZU5aeVJFcGxzaGw4WnJnTE5Za3A0S1JycHFscWZNdTZGbHc2a3JaMUMxOFNHd2M3RlFxVkpsdUNPUjVSYmtPNFJyRFBzTlg2Q1BQLUFIeEtZY3o1NDhPaWJORnkwdXF2MklNWmpuWnU3RXFnVk9ZTFdHRUdTX0I?oc=5","first_publisher":"Financial Times","earlier":[{"id":"e_1d12cadd4537","title":"Zelenskyy Says Ukraine Offered to Halt Strikes on Russian Refineries in Exchange for US Missile Defences","date":"2026-10-16T15:10:49Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNdDhidXhQcTVxMzA3Um1QbkprbnI1UDhVaVhhMW5CQmNGcWp2ZlNYWnFSUHBjVGhTQ0tLZTN1N3hkX01sclk0c01UanpJQ1h4ZVBzTXMxS3pPSWZ3bS1lWGJTakFoZlc3NW9aSk52bE16bzVsM21SaTJ3RUJwYTRpMA?oc=5","publisher":"EU Today","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_bfbc2c757da9","title":"Zelenskyy responds to Trump's criticism over Ukraine oil refinery strikes","date":"2026-10-16T15:23:49Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE5QeFhnc2pBZ3pYSUFkd3hfNGRBckZEcFRpdlVUeWoxMHkyWmZkVEpkeTBmNThkSDVkcmx3ZXJlOUU2V1hndmgtdjVMVWF0RllTSm1FYUF3?oc=5","publisher":"Fox News","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_51e3e0b6c489","title":"U.S. crude oil tops $100 as Iran escalates Hormuz attacks, Ukraine vows to hit Russian refineries","date":"2026-10-16T17:15:44Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"CNBC","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_b0be6948da1d","title":"Ukraine’s strikes on Russian oil refineries is not impacting US gas prices: report","date":"2026-10-17T00:48:00Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/arti